### Agent / internal ###
# CLAUDE.md is deliberately tracked: it is the repository's routing file.
#
# plans/ is NOT tracked. Planning content is private and is maintained outside this public
# repository. It was untracked in 7f68cd6 but the ignore rule was not restored at the same
# time, which left plans/ neither tracked nor ignored for a period - one `git add -A` away
# from being republished. A .gitignore entry does not untrack what is already tracked, and
# untracking does not ignore what is left behind; both halves are needed.
plans/
